## 4. AI & Tool Orchestration Comparison

| Feature | Express Backend (`futureabroad-master/backend`) | Python AI Backend (`ai-backend`) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Model Used** | OpenAI `gpt-4o-mini` | Google Gemini `gemini-2.5-flash` / `gemini-2.5-pro` |
| **API Client** | `openai` npm SDK | `google-genai` python SDK |
| **Execution Style** | Streaming agentic loop (Server-Sent Events) | Streaming (`chatbot.py`) & Structured JSON responses |
| **Search Grounding** | None | Enabled (Google Search Grounding config) |
| **Tool Execution** | In-process MCP server calling local database tools | Conversational stages validating values in backend schemas |

